# Local Gemini configuration example
# Copy this file to `.env.local` and set your real key locally (DO NOT commit `.env.local`).
# Note: This project reads Gemini key at runtime via `window.__GEMINI_API_KEY__`.
# For local testing, you can add a small script in `index.html` to set it from `.env.local` content,
# or set the value directly in your browser console for temporary testing.

GEMINI_API_KEY=YOUR_GEMINI_API_KEY_HERE
